<title>USA: U.S. FTC confirms commissioner went to Brussels.</title>
<headline>U.S. FTC confirms commissioner went to Brussels.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Federal Trade Commission member Mary Azcuenaga traveled to Brussels this week, agency officials said Thursday, but speculation she was meeting with the European Union competition commissioner could not be confirmed.</p>
<p>A spokeswoman for the FTC said she was unable to confirm speculation that Commissioner Azcuenaga was in Brussels to meet with EU Competition Commissioner Karel Van Miert about the proposed merger of Boeing Co and McDonnell Douglas Corp.</p>
</text>
